        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. During the months of October and February, agents of the Board shall review reported class loads and shall investigate instances where such loads exceed adopted guidelines. Based upon their investigation, they shall take appropriate action in accordance with this section of the Contract. The results of said review and any actions taken shall be provided to the Association.",
            "block_bbox": [
