                [
                    192.0,
                    287.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The teacher shall have a daily duty-free lunch period of at least twenty-five (25) minutes during scheduled days of instruction.",
            "block_bbox": [
                88,
                305,
                520,
                342
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    88.0,
                    304.9999694824219
                ],
                [
                    518.9999389648438,
                    304.9999694824219
                ],
                [
                    518.9999389648438,
                    336.9999694824219
                ],
                [
                    88.0,
                    336.9999694824219
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. On non-student contact days, teachers shall have a duty-free lunch time of one (1) hour and may, at their discretion, leave their worksite.",
            "block_bbox": [
                86,
                342,
                520,
                394
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    86.0,
                    342.0
                ],
                [
                    520.0,
                    342.0
                ],
                [
                    520.0,
                    394.0
                ],
                [
                    86.0,
                    394.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. On student contact days, in work locations where there is no lunchroom or in job assignments which permit flexible lunch scheduling, a teacher may be given approximately one (1) hour for lunch by mutual agreement with his immediate supervisor. If this occurs, the work day for the teacher may be proportionately extended to provide for equity with other teachers. This shall not be construed as a violation of Section A of this article.",
            "block_bbox": [
                85,
                395,
                521,
                522
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    85.0,
