                ],
                [
                    193.0,
                    520.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. All teachers shall have daily assigned planning time during which they shall not be responsible for students, in accordance with the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                85,
                539,
                519,
                592
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    85.0,
                    539.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    539.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    592.0
                ],
                [
                    85.0,
                    592.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Secondary and adult vocational teachers shall have a daily planning period equal to a student academic period but not less than fifty (50) minutes.",
            "block_bbox": [
                109,
                593,
                519,
                646
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    109.0,
                    593.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    593.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    646.0
                ],
                [
                    109.0,
                    646.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Planning time in the secondary schools shall be contiguous.",
            "block_bbox": [
                107,
                646,
                517,
                665
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    110.0,
                    646.0
                ],
                [
                    516.0,
                    646.0
                ],
                [
                    516.0,
                    664.0
                ],
                [
                    110.0,
                    664.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Elementary teachers shall have at least three hundred (300) minutes per week for use as planning time which shall include times during the regular workday before and after the student day and times when elementary special area teachers are conducting the class. Each elementary teacher shall have a contiguous daily planning time equal to at least thirty (30) minutes. Elementary teachers shall not be required to remain in the classroom when an elementary special area teacher is conducting a class.",
            "block_bbox": [
                108,
                659,
                519,
                825
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    108.0,
                    659.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    659.0
                ],
                [
                    519.0,
                    825.0
                ],
                [
                    108.0,
                    825.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. Each high school teacher shall have his preparation period within the student day.",
            "block_bbox": [
                107,
                825,
                518,
                860
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    107.0,
                    825.0
                ],
                [
                    518.0,
                    825.0
                ],
                [
                    518.0,
                    860.0
                ],
                [
                    107.0,
                    860.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. While planning time is intended for purposes of preparation, nothing herein shall preclude a teacher from using planning time for conferences with parents, administrators, or other teachers, or giving special assistance to students.",
            "block_bbox": [
                83,
                861,
                518,
                932
